## Result

Successfully installed and configured Apache Hadoop 3.5.0 in Ubuntu using Oracle VirtualBox. Created and executed a Java-based WordCount MapReduce application, verified the generated word frequencies in HDFS, explored Hadoop web interfaces, checked HDFS block health, and successfully stopped all Hadoop services.

**Experiment 9 completed successfully.**
